cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the beCPG Supplier Portal in your research or project, please cite it as below."
title: "beCPG Supplier Portal - Open Source Supplier Collaboration for beCPG PLM"
abstract: >
  Supplier-facing front end of beCPG PLM, the open-source PLM platform for the Food, Beverage
  and Cosmetics industries. Suppliers complete onboarding questionnaires, technical sheets and
  certificates; quality and purchasing teams monitor compliance and document expiry from a
  single space. Built as one Next.js application proxying the beCPG repository.
type: software
license: LGPL-3.0-or-later
url: "https://www.becpg.net"
repository-code: "https://github.com/becpg/becpg-supplier-portal"
keywords:
  - PLM
  - supplier portal
  - supplier collaboration
  - product lifecycle management
  - food industry
  - cosmetics
  - open source
  - Next.js
